<title>USA: WMS Industries unit targeted in lawsuit.</title>
<headline>WMS Industries unit targeted in lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>WMS Industries Inc said on Thursday its WMS Gaming unit is being accused of infringing on a patent held by International Game Technology.</p>
<p>At the heart of the lawsuit is a spinning reel slot machine made by WMS Gaming. WMS believes its Nevada machine does not infringe on IGT's patent. IGT is seeking an injunction and unspecified damages, WMS Gaming said.</p>
<p>A federal court has already ruled that a different type of WMS Gaming slot machine infringed on an IGT patent, a ruling that WMS Gaming is appealing.</p>
<p>WMS Industries designs and makes coin-operated games.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
